    "summary": "Triton Admin 1.0",
    "description": "# Authentication\nThis API uses basic authentication.\n\nBasic authentication is a simple authentication scheme built into the HTTP protocol. To use it, send your HTTP requests with an Authorization header that contains the word Basic followed by a space and a base64-encoded string `username:password`.\n\nExample: `Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwQDU1dzByZA==`\n\n**Username**\\\nYour webshop ID\n\n**Password**\\\nYour API key. You can create one in your webshop's back-end.",
    "contact": {
      "email": "support@e37.se",
      "url": "https://www.e37.se"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "E37 Triton",
      "url": "https://www.e37.se"
    }
  },
